<title>UK: NWE jet strengthens in line with futures.</title>
<headline>NWE jet strengthens in line with futures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE jet fuel rose on Friday in line with benchmark IPE gas oil futures gains, traders said.</p>
<p>Benchmark IPE gas oil closed $2.00 higher at $163.75 a tonne.</p>
<p>Jet fuel oil barge premiums were steady at around the July IPE +$15.00/$16.00 fob ARA level in quiet market.</p>
<p>Heating oil cargo premiums were assessed around the July IPE +$17/+$18 level. -- London Newsroom, +44 171 542 7714</p>
